                                "sense_id": "4b78afd7-cd15-3575-a09d-f0310920d75a",
                                "text": "That was two years ago, and Patricia MacLachlan, the author of the children's book from which the TV Sarah derived, has been prevailed upon to screenwrite a sequel."
